  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">La operacin continua las inversiones iniciadas por el HA-L1055, HA-L1076, HA-L1081 y HA-L1091 en el Parque Industrial de Caracol. Esta operacin proporcionar la infraestructura bsica, las instalaciones industriales, el respaldo administrativo y las inversiones complementarias que se necesiten para ampliar el Parque Industrial de Caracol y operarlo de forma sostenible.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The operation will continue the investments initiated by L1055, HA-L1076, HA-L1081 and HA-L1091 in the Industrial Park of Caracol. This operation will providing the basic infrastructure, industrial facilities, management support and complementary investments required for the expansion and sustainable operation of the PIC.</narrative>
  </description>
